[{"title":"苍玉洞","author":"蒋之奇","text":"全闽形势属临汀，赣岭连疆似井陉。\n江汇里渊销地脉，山横华盖应天星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44674,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石岩","author":"蒋之奇","text":"紫翠望云岚，山前一径杉。\n冥冥烟雨里，枉道访仙岩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44675,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广州州学记系诗","author":"蒋之奇","text":"诸侯之学，是谓泮水。\n诗人所颂，鲁侯戾止。\n献馘于是，献囚于是。\n采芹则美，饮酒维旨。\n淮夷来服，觓弓搜矢。\n其挚维何，元龟象齿。\n区区鲁邦，陋无足纪。\n维泮之兴，功烈如彼。\n下逮郑国，学校不修。\n青青子衿，莫肯来游。\n谁欲毁之，侨吉厥犹。\n视其所召，药之则瘳。\n我得吾师，实获所求。\n首善于京，其速置邮。\n矧在守长，宣化承流。\n德音不昭，维职之忧。\n番禺之学，莫原所作。\n岁月其绵，栋楹腐恶。\n藩级板夷，屋垣圮剥。\n图像之威，弗丹弗雘。\n圣经不谈，束置高阁。\n讲席其虚，维尘漠漠。\n譬彼弗殖，萎其将落。\n于嗟斯民，谁启谁觉。\n释老二氏，尚能尊师。\n岂伊吾儒，曾是弗为。\n道废若此，莫或耻之。\n振而起诸，岂不在兹。\n爰命鸠材，僝工以时。\n肇新两序，翼如翚飞。\n载辟祠庭，奂其轮而。\n颐指而化，鬼设神施。\n乃延师生，来燕来处。\n匪怒伊教，载笑载语。\n笾豆有践，殽核维旅。\n以妥以侑，礼仪具举。\n济间多士，进退规矩。\n夏弦春诵，各得其所。\n相彼错薪，有擢维楚。\n遐不作人，成是才谞。\n在汉循吏，时则文翁。\n修起学宫，成都市中。\n常衮在闽，讲导从容。\n士比内州，岁贡以充。\n贤不天成，有养自蒙。\n谁谓越远，齐鲁同风。\n憬彼夷蛮，来顺来从。\n南交厎宁，猗学之功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44676,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旴水诗","author":"蒋之奇","text":"旴江一带碧涟漪，来凭阑干把酒时。\n吏役不知春色晚，绯桃花发两三枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44677,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"麻源诗","author":"蒋之奇","text":"泉飞石磴尚微红，涧出铜陵碧数重。\n遥想谢公临郡日，几回屐齿印苔封。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44678,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章山永寿禅寺","author":"蒋之奇","text":"老僧七十九，自说少游方。\n试问章山景，炉添一炷香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44679,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游狼山寺","author":"蒋之奇","text":"不到狼山已十春，旧题犹覆碧纱尘。\n重来风物皆依旧，嬴得衰残老病身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44680,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冲寂观","author":"蒋之奇","text":"楼阁郁穹窿，清都幸此逢。\n兔藏贤令井，鲸吼贰卿钟。\n花覆瑶台暗，香飘宝鼎浓。\n仙居赤城洞，人住玉霄峰。\n棋响风敲竹，琴栖月在松。\n云霞随步武，猿鹤伴从容。\n湖涨销千尺，山浮黛色重。\n人间真福地，物外是灵踪。\n鹫岭标香刹，蛟溪接近封。\n枌榆偏在念，桑梓更惟恭。\n学道功成就，冲霄愿必从。\n他年随羽化，横跨葛坡龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44681,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"蒋之奇","text":"橘熟洞庭晓，胪肥笠泽秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44682,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"蒋之奇","text":"古寺当江湄，归舟昔尝往。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44683,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"蒋之奇","text":"九峰篸碧玉，一水剪青绡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44684,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"蒋之奇","text":"今日湖中石，当年天上星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44685,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"蒋之奇","text":"到门先见如丝瀑，恰似渊明醉石旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44686,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"蒋之奇","text":"雄豪何止压南州，天下临观应第一。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44687,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"蒋之奇","text":"贡水在东章在西，郁孤台与白云齐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44688,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"蒋之奇","text":"已跨白鹅归紫府，空留丹灶在人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44689,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"蒋之奇","text":"空传赵居士，不见纸衣僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44690,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"蒋之奇","text":"绿野有佳气，清淮无点尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44691,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"蒋之奇","text":"叔伟不见空缔建，正平何在独沧洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44692,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"蒋之奇","text":"白云飞鸟皆在下，一江峡水向东流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44693,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"蒋之奇","text":"泉明为邑日，漫叟卜居时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44694,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十四","author":"蒋之奇","text":"佛香红茉莉，番供碧玻璃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44695,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十五","author":"蒋之奇","text":"岿然三石佛，若在嘉州岸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44696,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十六","author":"蒋之奇","text":"文日闻贼报，七日走如烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44697,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十七","author":"蒋之奇","text":"功成乞身去，于此老吾生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44698,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十九","author":"蒋之奇","text":"龙归一饷云遮洞，猿叫三声月满山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44699,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十","author":"蒋之奇","text":"日月双连璧，乾坤一弹丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44700,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十一","author":"蒋之奇","text":"秀蹙青螺髻，香持白蟹螯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44701,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十二","author":"蒋之奇","text":"品待秋风鲈味美，重来桂玉啜齑橙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44702,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十四","author":"蒋之奇","text":"玉杯旧学无施设，空有新诗满锦囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44703,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送中济侍郎帅庆得行字","author":"范纯礼","text":"为国虽以德，御戎难去兵。\n夏人久犯顺，边氓常废耕。\n遣师杨我武，谋帅直非轻。\n辍自金谷寄，倚以关塞行。\n壮怀吞猖狂，沈机足经营。\n新伤乃民力，未振亦军声。\n既膺阃外寄，当思千里清。\n吾家世此官，所得蕃汉情。\n未尝任杀戮，接以信与诚。\n方略固多在，惟公守其成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44704,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幸太学倡和","author":"范纯礼","text":"四十馀年旧典章，圣君今复幸虞庠。\n虎贲万骑森罗列，雁序诸生俨缀行。\n已见重准同舜帝，不须无逸戒成王。\n祖宗基构隆三代，统业相承是肯堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44705,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梵安寺内浣溪四老唱和诗","author":"杨咸章","text":"闻说悬车三老儒，约为绘像访僧居。\n蟹螯杯酒欢无极，鼎足韬裘乐有馀。\n暑簟共观岷岭雪，春盘同脍蜀江鱼。\n归来一榻如相许，须信逍遥倍二疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44706,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甘露岩","author":"杨咸章","text":"屈曲山腰一径通，乱云芳草思无穷。\n尘埃从此去人远，我欲诛茅寄一峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44707,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗弟晦之通直有诗陈武信归簉三老之后损之喜继元韵以勉之","author":"杨损之","text":"未抛名利尚区区，方卜荣迁武信居。\n思簉林泉三老后，已经年纪七旬馀。\n且来在野同游鹿，莫学临渊却羡鱼。\n子美堂邻愿为约，免教朋友旧情疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44708,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谨次元韵呈严钧给事","author":"杨损之","text":"万里归陪老叟游，灿然雅什遗朋俦。\n云咸响亮清盈耳，霜雪缤纷白满头。\n三益画开裨古意，千钟酒饮破春愁。\n劝君莫倦桑榆景，未得为霖志未酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44709,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杰衰朽无取辱益之见招同诸友为四老会晦之承议有诗杰谨次元韵","author":"任杰","text":"夫子关西出众儒，肯来寻我卜幽居。\n忘忧棋局真佳趣，投老诗篇是绪馀。\n故旧已家吟伐木，太平只恐罩嘉鱼。\n主人醉指前溪路，松菊清凉月影疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44710,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杰伏蒙知府给事宠示佳章谨次元韵和呈","author":"任杰","text":"险阻艰难自遍游，归来寻访老交俦。\n七年弦顷嗟分袂，二月莺花喜聚头。\n美酒十分须共醉，劳生一梦更何愁。\n况君富贵功名在，从此男儿志可酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44711,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武仲伏承益之奉议转示晦之佳什谨依元韵次和","author":"杨武仲","text":"素发庞眉一陋儒，常陪龙友到禅居。\n我随益者诚多幸，人叹贤哉愧有馀。\n坐上共飞纯玉斝，腰间齐佩白银鱼。\n高吟清论常终日，会数朋交信不疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44712,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"承漠公承议颁示佳章谨次元韵","author":"杨武仲","text":"当年台阁仰英游，此日还乡接旧俦。\n共喜故人攀凤翼，伫膺新诏觐螭头。\n清欢且尽三春乐，闲饮能消五载愁。\n夸听郢中歌白雪，敢将巴曲强论酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44713,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州","author":"吕嘉问","text":"朱方藩牧寄非轻，故辍中朝近侍行。\n黼帐暂违簪笔对，锦衣初喜遇家荣。\n前临使宅千山秀，俯视堤封一水横。\n第恐急贤严召节，不容选胜遍江城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44714,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题张公洞","author":"单锷","text":"松菊投荒山水间，阿谁指点到仙寰。\n洞门龙出云犹湿，石至丹成火欲寒。\n百越楼台摩诘画，三吴烟水季鹰闲。\n陶然醉卧花间酒，细纳余香满袖还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44715,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巾山广轩","author":"徐亿","text":"胜景更新数步间，北山游得对巑岏。\n凭阑愈觉双峰峻，极目无涯六幕宽。\n特出喧卑资旷达，所临高远壮游盘。\n炎蒸此地为清暑，莫厌攀跻磴道难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44716,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"郎几","text":"伟哉言偃室，室外构凉轩。\n到觉一襟爽，坐祛三伏暄。\n植筠怜节操，引水爱潺湲。\n公暇无馀事，逍遥此释烦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44717,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"吕希彦","text":"酷暑如何避，虚轩落始成。\n地闲气易爽，境胜目须清。\n月上帘色静，风来竹坞鸣。\n公馀亦自适，山水入琴声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44718,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游嵩山联句","author":"王辟疆","text":"灵境中天秀，雄名古到今。\n位尊朝列岳，势重压千岑。\n静锁神仙宅，高盘宇宙心。\n孤棱标日月，绝仞倚戈坛。\n彩楝灵柯邃，层坛净刹深。\n民祈传觋语，国祀致君忱。\n碑古宇生字，堂虚画蠹金。\n山呼曾荐寿，神降即为霖。\n事怪涂山石，形端玉女砧。\n峰峦排翠玉，滩濑漱呜琴。\n蕙帐人谁继，金泥迹可寻。\n唐经藏宝妙，魏殿想銮音。\n云作他方雨，松连别院阴。\n谷泉长浸斗，顶路欲扪参。\n探穴魂潜动，扪萝力不禁。\n箕熊分蚁垤，伊洛认蹄涔。\n鸟道樵夫去，龙潭驿使临。\n众仙停羽驾，昔帝俨宸襟。\n选胜先看记，乘危可作箴。\n天门开四极，树品冠双林。\n灵药看苗斸，香醪挈榼斟。\n道宫庭不扫，学馆突无黔。\n垄麦风摇浪，溪淙石耸簪。\n杂花春烂漫，老木夜萧森。\n夕照河光接，晴岚塔影侵。\n深崖藏积雪，虚壑响幽禽。\n溪月寒澄霁，岩烟暮杳沈。\n寺桥横螮蝀，禅磬击谬琳。\n拂壁题新字，逢僧举旧吟。\n疲骖何处解，高阁在崎嵚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44719,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"王辟疆","text":"溪山环绕古城深，贤尹开轩日醉吟。\n大抵清虚虽得地，从来安静本由心。\n朝挥玉麈风生座，夜抚瑶琴月满襟。\n应笑陶潜种杨柳，五株门外不成阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44720,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题淡山岩","author":"王辟疆","text":"洞府深沉别有天，石门相贯碧孱颜。\n凿开混沌千年窍，坼破蓬莱一朵山。\n日玩嵌空僧不厌，时探幽怪客忘还。\n若教元子当初到，肯使朝阳播世间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44721,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"樊宗简","text":"邑署开轩槛，景閒宜快襟。\n檐虚月先上，地僻暑宁侵。\n夕照乱山远，风清群水深。\n政成足优逸，好自抚鸣琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44722,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"赵某","text":"古邑逢贤宰，构轩凉景生。\n尘埃不复到，泉石有馀清。\n诗得幽奇句，琴多雅淡声。\n居民陶美化，应此放高情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44723,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"杜叔献","text":"县僻少逢迎，闲轩得创营。\n先秋岚气肃，涉夏竹风清。\n待月诗中趣，分泉枕畔声。\n凭君植春柳，高节继渊明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44724,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"张锷","text":"潇洒吴夫子，搆轩山县中。\n何曾知大暑，每到便清风。\n林影乱不定，泉声咽复通。\n微吟倾白酒，日月任西东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44725,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"李鹏","text":"盛夏暑已极，此轩凉复生。\n天除前吏酷，地借长官清。\n种竹风乾树，敲棋月一枰。\n方知北窗傲，不独是渊明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44726,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"江泳","text":"一轩新创足清凉，岸帻披襟暇日长。\n极目闲田虞舆芮，凝神虚室老兼庄。\n檐牙高揭啄山色，簟角平舒约水光。\n料得北窗风更细，何妨笑傲比羲皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44727,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"赵中逵","text":"虚凉夺炎暑，因此得佳名。\n终日琴棋乐，四时风月清。\n捲帘对山色，攲枕听泉声。\n桃李新栽植，花开政已成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44728,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉轩","author":"张允","text":"凉轩无限景，茂宰乐清闲。\n拂榻夜延月，捲帘时对山。\n泉声来槛曲，野色入檐间。\n遥忆琴樽会，吟游路险难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44729,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游王官谷","author":"毌沆","text":"不污唐家乱，萧然表圣居。\n泉声舆山色，相得共清虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44730,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题招提院静照堂","author":"俞希旦","text":"槜李招提好，新堂向静开。\n因名求定慧，对镜悟西来。\n夜席常留月，寒阶暗落梅。\n师归得真趣，无复顾尘埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44731,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君宰吴江","author":"王介","text":"乍被轩绥宠，新辞计省繁。\n三江吴故国，百里汉郎官。\n烟水莼芽紫，霜天橘颗丹。\n优游民政外，风月即清欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44732,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出知湖州","author":"王介","text":"吴兴太守美如何，太守从来恶祝蛇。\n生若不为上柱国，死时犹合替阎罗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44733,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"王介","text":"上林春色好，携手去来兮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44734,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"王介","text":"命也岂终否，时乎不暂留。\n勉哉藏素业，以待岁之秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44735,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"王介","text":"草庐三顾动幽蛰，蕙帐一空生晓寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44736,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"王介","text":"金陵村里王夫子，可是能吟富贵诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44737,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题碧落洞","author":"高镈","text":"豁见仙源启翠岩，曾无锁钥易跻攀。\n临流便解尘缨濯，不信区区仕路难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44738,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佘山月轩","author":"朱伯虎","text":"爱月开轩绝顶间，屹然危创压层峦。\n剪除群卉当檐尽，添得清光满槛看。\n乱石云堆秋色冷，老松风入夜声寒。\n十年梦寐江乡景，杖屦终期日倚栏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44739,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"紫微山","author":"朱伯虎","text":"凿石开山已几年，半天台殿耸危峦。\n晓钟声向云边落，夜月光从槛底看。\n野色难藏千里秀，松风长占一轩寒。\n老僧此处真佳隐，应笑尘劳效小官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44740,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"朱伯虎","text":"松竹萧森水石闲，亭台高下耸层峦。\n环观叠嶂千重碧，俯瞰澄江万顷寒。\n佳景真宜南国诧，画图堪与北人看。\n使君贤雅能行乐，肯向东山羡谢安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44741,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈倩曾公岩韵","author":"齐谌","text":"天作地藏知几年，公来因得茂林间。\n谁言物外真仙境，祇接人居近郭山。\n石乳望中苍玉坠，泉源深处卧龙闲。\n行看再为苍生起，乘兴从容重返还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44742,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘谊老君岩韵 其一","author":"齐谌","text":"巨石何年此结成，老君肖像亦强名。\n以身为患言犹在，谩使时人分重轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44743,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]